 "review": {
  "verdict": "approve",
  "critique": "Top call of Microtubule Stabilizers is well-supported across 4 wells at dose 5 twice and doses 6–7: the phenotype is not just an increase in microtubule intensity, it is increased tubule mean with bundled, coarse structuring that breaks down into the low-dimensional molecular signature. The runner-ups (Microtubule Destabilizers, Aurora kinase inhibitors, and Eg5 inhibitors) do not explain that increased polymer-like texture together with bundled perinuclear rings as well as the top class does, even allowing for the reduced strength in the dose 5 replicate.",
  "requested_experiment": null
 },
